#: ../../source/docs/choosing-a-frame.rst:7 c81a8f6e1c76447ba943794db6e66192
msgid ""
"One of the first steps in using Copter is to decide on the frame.  Shown "
"below are three options from `3DR <https://www.3dr.com/>`__ but there are "
"hundreds of other choices.  This page will hopefully give some guidance on "
"the choices available."
msgstr ""
"使用 Copter 的第一步是确定机架。以下展示了 `3DR <https://www.3dr.com/>`__ "
"的三个选项，但还有数百种其他选择。本页将为您提供一些关于可用选择的指导。"

