msgid "Ready-To-Fly, Kits or Build your Own"
msgstr "即飞版、套件或自行组装"

#: ../../source/docs/choosing-a-frame.rst:37 9890adbc5935492c92117a10bf7fc1c3
msgid ""
"The choice of Ready-to-fly (RTF) vs Build-your-Own mostly comes down to how "
"much time you are happy to spend building up your copter and how "
"personalised you wish it to be.  With the growing number of low-cost RTF "
"copters on the market, there is likely little cost advantage to building "
"your own, especially for the smaller copters and if you factor in some "
"missteps along the way (like buying the wrong parts)."
msgstr ""
"选择即飞版（RTF）还是自行组装，主要取决于您愿意花多少时间组装飞机以及希望定制化的程度。随着市面上低成本 RTF "
"飞机数量不断增加，自行组装在成本上可能没有太大优势，尤其是对于较小的飞机，若再考虑到过程中的失误（如购买错误的零件），更是如此。"

